ides of Celia.\\\\n\\\\nSo both are possible.\\\\n\\\\nBut from (5): Elsa is between Yara and Wren \u2192 so Yara and Wren are on opposite sides of Elsa.\\\\n\\\\nSo Elsa is between Yara and Wren \u2192 so Yara\u2013Elsa\u2013Wren or Wren\u2013Elsa\u2013Yara.\\\\n\\\\nAlso, from (1): Yara is next to Celia.\\\\n\\\\nSo Yara is adjacent to Celia.\\\\n\\\\nBut Yara is on one side of Elsa, and Celia is adjacent to Elsa.\\\\n\\\\nLet\u2019s try to build a chain.\\\\n\\\\nLet\u2019s suppose the order is: **Yara \u2013 Elsa \u2013 Wren**\\\\n\\\\nThen from (5): Elsa is between Yara and Wren \u2192 OK.\\\\n\\\\nFrom (1): Yara is next to Celia \u2192 so Celia must be adjacent to Yara.\\\\n\\\\nSo Celia must be to the left of Yara (since Yara is on the left of Elsa).\\\\n\\\\nSo: Celia \u2013 Yara \u2013 Elsa \u2013 Wren\\\\n\\\\nBut from (4): Elsa is next to Celia \u2192 but here Celia is two seats away from Elsa \u2192 not adjacent \u2192 contradiction.\\\\n\\\\nSo Celia cannot be to the left of Yara in this case.\\\\n\\\\nAlternatively, if Celia is to the right of Yara \u2192 but Yara is already next to Elsa, so if Celia is to the right of Yara, then Celia would be next to Yara and possibly next to Elsa.\\\\n\\\\nBut in the sequence: Yara \u2013 Elsa \u2013 Wren\\\\n\\\\nThen Celia must be adjacent to Yara \u2192 so Celia must be to the left of Yara.\\\\n\\\\nBut then Celia is not adjacent to Elsa \u2192 unless Celia is in seat left of Yara, and Yara is in seat 2, Celia in 1, Elsa in\\\"},\\\"finish_reason\\\":\\\"length\\\",\\\"logprobs\\\":null}],\\\"model\\\":\\\"Qwen/Qwen3-VL-30B-A3B-Instruct\\\",\\\"created\\\":1794483394,\\\"usage\\\":{\\\"prompt_tokens\\\":187,\\\"total_tokens\\\":1187,\\\"completion_tokens\\\":1000}}\",\"signature\":{\"text\":\"Qwen/Qwen3-VL-30B-A3B-Instruct:f672c45306c3cce5150a920b4ab941de826a6dc950503a13c55844db85239a77:aa53975f152cb7415b5a3bfa79ebaecdf47d929058a2028d6e9a41b1b9045a48\",\"signature\":\"0x042ef42e10da0a65bd1d3c8689522fc10546311c497