nPattern Y: L < O < P < A.\\\\n\\\\nNow C1 N between L and A. Need consider patterns.\\\\n\\\\nPattern X: A < P < O < L. L and A endpoints with A left, L right. N must be between: A < N < L. Could be in positions among P/O or other between. Since P,O already between. N can be between A and L, not equal. So N somewhere after A before L. It could be between A and P, between P and O, between O and L. But all seats.\\\\n\\\\nPattern Y: L < O < P < A. L left, A right. N between: L < N < A. Could be between L/O, O/P, P/A.\\\\n\\\\nC4 F between L and O.\\\\n\\\\nPattern X: A < P < O < L. L right, O left of L. F between O and L: O < F < L. Could be after O before L. Not seat? Pattern Y: L < O. F between L and O: L < F < O.\\\\n\\\\nNeed fit six with N too.\\\\n\\\\nLet's enumerate positions 1-6.\\\\n\\\\nPattern X: order constraints A < P < O < L, N between A,L, F between O,L. Since A not seat1. Need assign 6 distinct. Let's attempt.\\\\n\\\\nIn pattern X, A cannot be 1, so A at >=2. Since A<P<O<L, minimal positions: A=2,P=3,O=4,L=5 maybe, leaving 1,6 for N,F. But N between A,L can be 3/4/5? Actually N not A/P/O/L positions, only remaining 1 or6 if those four occupy 2-\\\"},\\\"finish_reason\\\":\\\"length\\\",\\\"logprobs\\\":null}],\\\"model\\\":\\\"z-ai/glm-5.3-flash\\\",\\\"created\\\":1794483395,\\\"usage\\\":{\\\"prompt_tokens\\\":187,\\\"total_tokens\\\":1187,\\\"completion_tokens\\\":1000,\\\"prompt_tokens_details\\\":null,\\\"reasoning_tokens\\\":0,\\\"completion_tokens_details\\\":{\\\"reasoning_tokens\\\":0}}}\",\"signature\":{\"text\":\"z-ai/glm-5.3-flash:29126b65d866f6060eb2aaf44922c7d0609ee389f863192b377ee5e9d7c29331:a4a6e324de300b2313755f1aabe291f239be86dd591a05fa25d2baa6b82fb9ca\",\"signature\":\"0x5f2e5f31e0ba9a843baebf33228065e1bb61b00bb3f916b2dbc67a7e4c15489f7e2b41146cbca5fac947d64d6501209c3feecfc821411ede01c1ff565c44decd1b\",\"signing_address\":\"0x3b753b4406613c5e70ae640508632b600424fa0c\",\"signing_algo\":\"ecdsa\",\"signature_kind\":\"provider_tee\"},